#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:1
#: 3e7625c684fa40a282ce862f5d92f232
msgid "Single Node Rapid Deployment of Docker Containers"
msgstr "单节点快速部署 Docker 容器"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:3
#: a0ab8ddd07aa441285e720ec31929688
msgid ""
"First of all, after successfully deploying and installing Docker in a "
"Linux environment, in order to perform a single-node rapid deployment of "
"Docker containers, you need to follow the steps below to perform the "
"deployment process:"
msgstr ""
"首先，在 Linux 环境中成功部署和安装 Docker 后，为了执行 Docker 容器的单节"
"点快速部署，需要按照以下步骤执行部署过程："

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:4
#: 565fc9f7a0fa42af997eb4c908d440ce
msgid "1. Prerequisites"
msgstr "1.部署前提"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:5
#: fbb4b5fff0c04d99a50b36f7bf9c4d43
msgid ""
"Ensure that your Linux system has successfully installed the Docker "
"container engine and that the Docker service is running normally."
msgstr ""
"确保 Linux 系统已成功安装 Docker 容器引擎，且 Docker 服务运行正常。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:7
#: 856498b04cf445bcb892c9ce37b10dc3
msgid "2. Environment preparation"
msgstr "2.环境准备"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:8
#: 78ae598d36d84231b26dfb646050cb1e
msgid "Environment description"
msgstr "环境描述"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:9
#: cf2bf07a61e240e8b212352932c56afa
msgid "Configure the git docker docker-compose environment in advance;"
msgstr "提前配置 git docker docker-compose 环境；"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:19
#: a8e373a265f8455f88d03b3d7ddcc683
msgid "Pull-out Container"
msgstr "拉取容器"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:26
#: 8a79070a612044a69cf7ba75a8f98d7e
msgid "3. Starting containers"
msgstr "3.启动容器"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:27
#: 03ebe336fdb249048cd3af30dfdd64f9
msgid ""
"Here we need to start containers based on docker-compose, so let's first "
"go pull: docker-compose."
msgstr ""
"在这里，我们需要基于 docker-compose 启动容器，所以先拉一下：docker-"
"compose。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:28
#: c947110abeae4e0a8a1cb0e67304ac86
msgid "Pull the corresponding docker-compose configuration"
msgstr "提取相应的 docker-compose 配置"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:37
#: 6151423005da4386882398104a5fba97
msgid "**Configuration file description:**"
msgstr "**配置文件描述：**"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:38
#: 59fad33986d5456e84c72dcb3d46b98d
msgid ""
"docker-compose.yml for single-node multi-service, where the full startup "
"contains 3 coordinator, 3 store, 3 index, 1 executor, 1 web (proxy);"
msgstr ""
"用于单节点多服务的 docker-compose.yml，其中完整的启动包含 3 个"
"coordinator, 3 个store, 3个 index, 1 个executor, 1 个web (proxy);"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:39
#: 4a67a735900d4a1f80d59ad88d4e8b2d
msgid ""
"docker-compose.single.yml is a single node, single service, where the "
"full startup contains 1 coordinator, 1 store, 1 index, 1 executor, 1 web "
"(proxy); * coordinator, store, index use host network, executor, web "
"(proxy) use net network."
msgstr ""
"docker-compose.single.yml 是一个单节点、单服务，其中完整的启动包含 1 个"
"coordinator, 1 个store, 1个 index, 1 个executor, 1 个web (proxy)；* "
"coordinator, store, index 使用主机网络，executor, web (proxy) 使用网络。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:40
#: 5bb601095c534551889450c0bd638084
msgid ""
"The coordinator, store, and index use the host network, and the executor "
"and web(proxy) use the net network."
msgstr ""
"coordinator、store和index 使用主机网络，executor 和 web(proxy)使用网络。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:41
#: a313fe2600b34396a20bfedf141b7cc5
msgid "Start the corresponding container"
msgstr "启动相应的容器"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:47
#: 1bd19a18d5fc4d9287fece6118f389e5
msgid "4. Viewing cluster status"
msgstr "4.查看群集状态"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:48
#: 6d962d2c69574fc5a33b64c464798a58
msgid "Check container status"
msgstr "检查容器状态"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:49
#: 98ce44a93556456a85c693c181582e47
msgid ""
"Checks if all containers in the yml configuration file are in the Up "
"state."
msgstr "检查 yml 配置文件中的所有容器是否都处于 “启动 ”状态。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:53
#: bc81ecd5d2b642228cba30704acd38f3
msgid "View process status"
msgstr "查看流程状态"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:54
#: 58351edfcc384ce78d8927682df4261b
msgid "View coordinator status"
msgstr "查看coordinator 状态"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:63
#: 34ec5f12ffa5482897d99b01920d9279
msgid "Check the Store status"
msgstr "检查Store 状态"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:72
#: 27788711d3784a5ba0ded9161fb05117
msgid ""
"Checking the status of the Executor. To check the status of executor, "
"just check the log and make sure mysql init is successful."
msgstr ""
"检查Executor的状态。要检查Executor的状态，只需查看日志并确保 mysql init "
"成功即可。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/linux.md:77
#: 1cd1ec033ff6414da7304c082fb0ba86
msgid ""
"Check the status of the Proxy. Web(Proxy) can be viewed through swagger, "
"you need to replace the IP in the URL with your own IP address."
msgstr ""
"检查Proxy的状态。可以通过 swagger 查看 Web（Proxy），但需要用自己的 IP 地"
"址替换 URL 中的 IP。"
